  },
  data: {
    LLM: 'Players ante and are dealt one card each face down. Without looking, each holds the card to their forehead so all other players can see it. A round of poker betting follows (fold, check, bet, call, raise). After betting, remaining players reveal; highest card wins the pot. Ties split the pot; there is no suit order. In the bull variant, the highest and lowest cards share the pot.',
    Player: 'Players ante and are dealt one card each face down. Without looking, each holds the card to their forehead so all other players can see it. A round of poker betting follows (fold, check, bet, call, raise). After betting, remaining players reveal; highest card wins the pot. Ties split the pot; there is no suit order. In the bull variant, the highest and lowest cards share the pot.',
    objective: 'Win the pot by having the highest card at showdown among players who did not fold, or in the bull variant by having either the highest or lowest card (high and low share the pot).',
    gameplay: 'Players ante and are dealt one card each face down. Without looking, each holds the card to their forehead so all other players can see it. A round of poker betting follows (fold, check, bet, call, raise). After betting, remaining players reveal; highest card wins the pot. Ties split the pot; there is no suit order. In the bull variant, the highest and lowest cards share the pot.',
    keyRules: [
      "One card each held to forehead; players see others' cards but not their own.",
      'Players ante before the deal.',
      'Standard poker betting: fold, check, bet, call, raise.',
      'Showdown: highest card wins; ties share the pot; no suit order.',
      'Bull variant: highest and lowest cards share the pot.',
    ],
    bonusRuleGuids: [],
